
Chapter 11: Diagonal Z₂ Symmetries
====================================
Original Hamiltonian (4 qubits):
  0.3 IIZZ + 0.2 IZIZ + 0.8 ZIZI - 0.4 ZZII

Diagonal Z₂ symmetric qubits: [|0; 1; 2; 3|]

(+1,+1) sector:
  4 → 2 qubits
  Removed: [|1; 3|]
  Result: 0.2 II + 0.3 IZ - 0.4 ZI + 0.8 ZZ

(-1,+1) sector:
  4 → 2 qubits
  Removed: [|1; 3|]
  Result: -0.2 II + 0.3 IZ + 0.4 ZI + 0.8 ZZ

Auto (+1 sector for all): 4 → 0 qubits
  Result: 0.9 
